2429
01:52:26,619 --> 01:52:28,560
You're gonna get a turn, a turn and a half.

2430
01:52:28,560 --> 01:52:30,520
Maybe you do 120 people at those 50 seats.

2431
01:52:30,520 --> 01:52:31,779
Maybe you can only do 75.

2432
01:52:31,779 --> 01:52:33,420
So you're capped by the turnover.

2433
01:52:33,420 --> 01:52:34,239
Right.

2434
01:52:34,239 --> 01:52:35,840
I don't think you like caps very much.

2435
01:52:35,840 --> 01:52:37,600
But the one, correct.

2436
01:52:37,600 --> 01:52:41,020
And one of the cool things though about Disney

2437
