2441
01:52:50,439 --> 01:52:52,199
Next 30 people come in.

2442
01:52:52,199 --> 01:52:54,539
every 10 minutes, 8 minutes, whatever it is.

2443
01:52:54,539 --> 01:52:55,699
Yeah, whatever it is.

2444
01:52:55,699 --> 01:52:58,300
And I was like, you know,

2445
01:52:58,300 --> 01:52:59,599
I wanted to do a restaurant that way,

2446
