2449
01:53:07,119 --> 01:53:08,679
And we talked about it for years.

2450
01:53:08,679 --> 01:53:10,720
I analyzed it to death and I'm like,

2451
01:53:10,720 --> 01:53:12,619
the economic, you'd have to charge way more

2452
