And people pay $500 to go to what XYZ pop up.

2459
01:53:29,000 --> 01:53:30,000
They don't really make money.

2460
01:53:30,000 --> 01:53:31,199
That's the weird secret of it.

2461
01:53:31,199 --> 01:53:32,880
Cause it's the production's too high.

2462
01:53:32,880 --> 01:53:33,720
Okay.

2463
01:53:33,720 --> 01:53:35,179
But then I was sitting there going,

2464
01:53:35,179 --> 01:53:36,760
it would work for magic.

2465
01:53:36,760 --> 01:53:39,519
The theater scale needs to be different.

2466
01:53:39,519 --> 01:53:41,679
You know, it's like when you go see Siegfried and Roy

2467
01:53:41,679 --> 01:53:44,079
or whatever and a lion pops out,

2468
01:53:44,079 --> 01:53:46,179
it's not that surprising because there's a giant stage

2469
