and they can hide a lion.

2470
01:53:47,679 --> 01:53:49,840
But if we're in a little room and a lion pops out,

2471
01:53:49,840 --> 01:53:52,059
holy shit, that's something, right?

2472
01:53:52,060 --> 01:53:53,780
Because it's new.

2473
