A really great close-up magician is a thing of beauty.

2477
01:54:07,380 --> 01:54:08,660
It is an art form.

2478
01:54:08,660 --> 01:54:10,539
It's like watching a great musician

2479
01:54:10,539 --> 01:54:12,020
or a great ballerina or something like that.

2480
01:54:12,020 --> 01:54:12,860
It's awesome.

2481
01:54:12,860 --> 01:54:14,900
I mean, I'm getting choked up thinking about

2482
01:54:14,900 --> 01:54:17,500
some of these people and what they do to make it happen.

2483
01:54:17,500 --> 01:54:18,780
It's amazing.

2484
