How many square feet do you think we would need?

2489
01:54:29,119 --> 01:54:31,099
You know, all these things, and we email back and forth.

2490
01:54:31,099 --> 01:54:33,619
And the day I closed on this,

2491
01:54:33,619 --> 01:54:35,359
and my wife was running,

2492
01:54:35,359 --> 01:54:37,359
she runs women's hiking groups all around the world.

2493
01:54:37,359 --> 01:54:40,579
She was on a hike somewhere, I think Portugal, maybe?

2494
01:54:40,579 --> 01:54:41,619
Somewhere in Europe.

2495
01:54:41,619 --> 01:54:44,699
And I was terrified of this whole thing.

2496
