And I get a FedEx package and it's from Nate.

2497
01:54:48,340 --> 01:54:50,279
And it says, hey, Nick, thank you so much.

2498
01:54:50,279 --> 01:54:51,940
This is what I've been working on for the last eight months.

2499
01:54:51,940 --> 01:54:52,900
Thanks for the inspiration.

2500
01:54:52,900 --> 01:54:54,699
Thanks for the questions.

2501
01:54:54,699 --> 01:54:59,400
And here is my proposal for how to do that thing

2502
01:54:59,400 --> 01:55:01,640
that you told me about.

2503
01:55:01,640 --> 01:55:04,000
And I think it's the solution to everything.

2504
