2505
01:55:06,220 --> 01:55:09,220
I'm on a 10 day trip to Canada with my family

2506
01:55:09,220 --> 01:55:11,900
that I take every year and I'll be completely off the grid.

2507
01:55:11,900 --> 01:55:13,699
So I'm sitting up there and I got a lot of shit

2508
01:55:13,699 --> 01:55:15,020
to worry about here.

2509
01:55:15,020 --> 01:55:16,319
And I read the whole thing.

2510
01:55:16,319 --> 01:55:20,199
And every like 10th page, there was a QR code

